  message: "Shipped in PR #3216 (merged to dev). Added test-agent-infra job to full-suite.yml: self-hosted runner, Python 3.11, cgroup-aware pytest-xdist, runs pytest tests/ --no-cov --tb=short. Wired into aggregate job's needs list AND conclusion calculation so it's a hard gate. Guarded by changes.outputs.code == 'true'. WI-bukag (merged first in #3215) cleared the 3 pre-existing failures that would have made this job go red on merge. Follow-up still open: teach ci.yml smart-test to recognize .agent/hooks/_shared/ + scripts/ as source paths for per-PR gating (not this PR's scope)."  # 1456
